cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below.
  The datasets produced with it (real-hardware job ledgers, per-cell
  recovered energies, timing) are archived separately on Zenodo -- see
  the "references" entry below.
title: vib-sqd
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Kunal
    family-names: Kumar
abstract: >-
  A Qiskit-native workflow for vibrational-state simulation with
  sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD): MidasCpp force-field
  parsing, classical-to-quantum warm-start initialization for the
  UVCCSD/VLUCJ/VIm-uCJ/Vg-uCJ/CHC ansatz family, and a self-consistent
  recovery loop for the ground and excited vibrational states.
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/qiskit-community/vib-sqd"
references:
  - type: dataset
    title: >-
      Vibrational-SQD real-hardware results: per-cell recovered
      energies, job ledgers, and timing
    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23011464
